    {
      "index": 0,
      "mapName": "A- Catherine's Charge.h3m",
      "regionText": "Eeofol troops have pushed to Erathia's border.  Queen Catherine herself has chosen to stay the tide of these invaders by controlling the border and digging in until reinforcements can arrive.  Catherine must not fail.",
      "prologText": "I have underestimated my opponent's strength and resolve.  During the Restoration Wars, the Kreegans were of minor concern.  Now they fight with an urgency neither I nor Roland have encountered.  I have pulled the bulk of my forces back behind Erathia's border.  Between us and the Kreegans lies Moss Valley.  It is one of Erathia's more beautiful landscapes.  Tactically, it is ideal.  If I can hold this valley, I can close the border.  Then I can determine how to destroy the demon king Lucifer and his quest to set the world on fire with Armageddon's Blade.",
