    {
      "index": 1,
      "mapName": "B- Seeking Armageddon.h3m",
      "regionText": "The greatest hero in all Eeofol is Xeron the Terrible.  He has been attempting to fulfill King Lucifer's vision for some time now, but every time he has gotten close to one of the objects needed to build Armageddon's Blade, a hero from the Elemental Conflux has arrived to take it.  Now he has them cornered in Avlee and they are ripe for the picking.",
      "prologText": "My quest is sacred, given to me by the king himself.  I have searched the continent for the relics he desires.  When I have come close, a mysterious hero has spirited my prize away.  I have pursued these heroes for months.  Now, I have them cornered.  They will either surrender the relics, their lives... or both.",
      "preconditions": 5,
      "difficulty": "Hard",
