    {
      "index": 5,
      "mapName": "F- A Blade in the Back.h3m",
      "regionText": "Gelu must take his army to cut off any escape routes the Eeofol army might be able to use.  King Roland and general Kendal are moving against the Kreegans and pushing them towards him, along with Queen Catherine's forces.  To ensure King Lucifer is defeated, the Kreegans must not be allowed to escape.",
      "prologText": "In my operations, information is always scarce, and never given full trust.  Now I am told the elemental Confluxes we have encountered, have allied with Queen Catherine in her war to destroy King Lucifer Kreegan.  I have orders to move deep into Eeofol, behind the main Kreegan force Catherine holds at the border.  There I am to cut off any potential escape route.  I pray this is not a trap.",
